e-1 iDsEnl duHtQR"><div class="Banner__HeroContent-sc-1ks4fe-2 fRIfkN"><h1 data-testid="cdr-centre-heading">TSX CDR Centre</h1><h2 style="font-size:20px">Your Canadian Passport to Global Markets</h2></div></div><div class="layoutStyling__BodyContainer-sc-1im3qdr-0 Banner__WhiteBackgroundSection-sc-1ks4fe-3 iDsEnl eyTanj"><div class="Banner__ContentSection-sc-1ks4fe-4 dRjgdx"><div class="Banner__BannerCopy-sc-1ks4fe-5 dodKGx"><p>Canadian Depositary Receipts (CDRs) offer Canadian investors the opportunity to invest in some of the biggest U.S. and international companies directly on TSX, in Canadian dollars.</p><p>With Canadian investors in mind, CDRs provide built-in currency hedging with a fractional share ownership structure. CDRs are designed to track the intraday and day-to-day performance of some of the biggest companies in the world. Making it easier and more affordable to diversify your investment portfolio right here in Canada.</p><p>Learn more about investing in CDRs <a style="display:inline-block">here</a>.</p></div><div class="Banner__VideoContainer-sc-1ks4fe-6 fAFfCr"><div name="banner-video"><div class="CdrVideos__Container-sc-10x9tcp-0 buZlEh"><div class="CdrVideos__Body-sc-10x9tcp-1 WyYCV"><div class="CdrVideos__VideoContainer-sc-10x9tcp-2 SjzFt"><div class="CdrVideos__PlayerWrapper-sc-10x9tcp-3 kUeUKI"><iframe title="CDR Centre Video" src="https://play.vidyard.com/eiLkpQy5B8g2idndL1Twsp.html" scrolling="yes" allowfullscreen="" referrerPolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" class="CdrVideos__StyledIframe-sc-10x9tcp-4 wkayO"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:30px" class="layoutStyling__BodyContainer-sc-1im3qdr-0 CDRCentre__StocklistContainer-sc-14a01hl-1 iDsEnl jCgRTK"><div name="top-performing-cdrs"><h3 class="CibcCdrStockListTable__TableHeading-sc-lwe79y-1 iqCjoG">Comprehensive CDRs List</h3><div class="CibcCdrStockListTable__TableContainer-sc-lwe79y-0 eSBGLu"><div class="CibcC